---
import V6Layout from '../layouts/V6Layout.astro';
import Panel from '../components/v6/Panel.astro';

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<V6Layout
  ink
  title="What is Forró? — Tome Forró Berlin"
  description="Forró is a partner dance from northeastern Brazil, danced to accordion, zabumba drum, and triangle. You need no partner and no experience to start."
>
  <Panel
    id="what-is-forro"
    label="From the Sertão to Berlin"
    title="What is Forró?"
    lede="A partner dance from northeastern Brazil. You can learn the base step in one class."
  >
    <div class="panel__body">
      <p>
        Forró is a partner dance from northeastern Brazil. Three instruments carry the music:
        accordion, zabumba drum, and triangle. The dance comes from the Sertão, the dry backcountry
        of the northeast.
      </p>

      <p>
        Dancers hold a close embrace, and the follow sets the distance. The base step moves side to
        side, and beginners dance it within their first class.
      </p>

      <blockquote class="pullquote">
        "The village expands beyond the dance floor."
      </blockquote>

      <p>
        You do not need a partner. Dancers change partners through the evening, so you can arrive
        alone. You do not need experience, and you do not need to book ahead for a drop-in class.
      </p>

      <p>
        Berlin has classes and socials every week, run by organizers across the city. Our calendar
        lists all of them in one place, whoever runs them.
      </p>

      <div class="btn-row">
        <a href={`${base}/calendar`} class="btn">See the calendar</a>
        <a href={`${base}/faq`} class="btn">Read the FAQ</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Panel>
</V6Layout>
